<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ shop.name }} — Próximamente</title>
  {{ content_for_header }}
  {{ 'theme.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #fafafa; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; }
    .pw-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 56px 48px; max-width: 440px; width: 90%; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .pw-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .pw-logo span { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .pw-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    .pw-sub { color: #666; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 32px; }
    .pw-form input { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1.5px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: none; }
    .pw-form input:focus { border-color: #E8621A; }
    .pw-form button { width: 100%; background: #E8621A; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .pw-form button:hover { background: #C44A1E; }
    .pw-enter { margin-top: 16px; }
    .pw-enter summary { font-size: 13px; color: #999; cursor: pointer; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pw-card">
    <div class="pw-logo">
      <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 96 96" fill="none">
        <circle cx="48" cy="48" r="47" fill="#E8621A"/>
        <text x="48" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="26" font-weight="900" font-family="Arial Black,Arial,sans-serif">ULTRA</text>
      </svg>
      <span>belleza</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="pw-title">Próximamente ✨</h1>
    <p class="pw-sub">Estamos preparando algo increíble para ti.<br>Déjanos tu correo y sé la primera en enterarte.</p>

    {% form 'customer', id: 'pw-newsletter' %}
      <div class="pw-form">
        <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="tu@correo.com" required aria-label="Correo electrónico">
        <button type="submit">Avisarme cuando abramos</button>
      </div>
    {% endform %}

    <details class="pw-enter">
      <summary>¿Tienes contraseña? Entrar →</summary>
      {{ content_for_layout }}
    </details>
  </div>
  {{ 'theme.js' | asset_url | script_tag }}
</body>
</html>
